<<say "Skuttle" "Now answer me this: Were you followed!? Spotted!? Clocked!? Trailed!? Stalked!? Spied!? Seen in situ!? Sent by THEM!???" "frantic">>
<<stage "You struggle to remember. It's been such a long and exhausting journey so far.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Definitely not!" "A4 Skuttle Talk 3a" -5>>
<<reply "How would I know?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 3b" 5>>
<</choices>>

:: A4 Skuttle Talk 2b [dialogue act4 char-Skuttle] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
