<<choices>>
<<reply "Definitely not!" "A4 Skuttle Talk 3a" -5>>
<<reply "How would I know?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 3b" 5>>
<</choices>>

:: A4 Skuttle Talk 3a [dialogue act4 char-Skuttle] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "BANG!">>
<<stage "You recoil at the sound of fin slapping metal from inside the shack.">>
<<say "Skuttle" "HOW DO YOU KNOW!?" "manic">>
<<say "Skuttle" "You really think *THEY* are just going to slither out of the shadows, tap you on the shoulder and say, 'Hey, watch out, I'm following you?' You must be a few parcels short of a full post cart, pal!" "manic">>
<<stage "You take a long look at Skuttle's metal viewing slot, and wonder whether it can be closed from the outside...">>
<<say "Skuttle" "You really want me to trust you? Answer me this final question. It's a big one. The BIGGEST one, maybe." "whispered">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Who is the only person you can rely on in this ocean?" "gravely">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Myself!" "A4 Skuttle Talk 4a" -5>>
<<reply "Um... You?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 4b" 5>>
<</choices>>

<<stage "CLANGCLANGCLANG!">>
<<stage "You recoil at the sound of pots and pans crashing to the floor from within the shack.">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Exactly! You wouldn't. YOU COULDN'T!" "excited">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Maybe I judged you too hastily. Maybe you're the full stamp book, you know? Or at least not a complete empty diving suit..." "reflective">>
<<stage "You take a long look at Skuttle's metal viewing slot, and wonder whether it can be closed from the outside...">>
<<say "Skuttle" "But if you really want me to trust you? Answer me this final question. It's a big one. The BIGGEST one, maybe." "gravely">>
<<say "Skuttle" "Who is the only person you can rely on in this ocean?" "whispered">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Myself!" "A4 Skuttle Talk 4a" -5>>
<<reply "Um... You?" "A4 Skuttle Talk 4b" 5>>
<</choices>>

